/* Modified 2026-10-13 by spotUP for UP-Term (ixemul-vtcon); see the git history. */

This file contains the version number and date of ixemul.library. Do not
modify library/version.c or library/version.h. These files are generated by
the parse_version tool from the contents of this file.

The format of the first line is:

major.minor,day.month.year

Anything after that line is ignored.
